    "units": "mm",
    "source_status": "DoR standard drawing, July 2015",
    "construction": "Reinforced concrete (RC), precast in casting yard; NOT prestressed.",
    "geometry_notes": [
      "Midspan outline transcribed from the 'SECTION OF PRECAST BEAM AT MID SPAN (TYP.)' view (Drg 5/10, PDF p7). The view is cut through an intermediate stiffener, so its rectangular 700-wide outline is the stiffener; the I outline inside it is the beam.",
      "Splay horizontal 187.5 = (700-325)/2, printed as 187^5 in Drg 7/10 Detail 'Y' (PDF p9) of both volumes.",
